sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Server
    participant Database

    Client->>Server: HTTP Request
    Server->>Server: 创建 WithTimeout(3s)
    Server->>Database: QueryRowContext(ctx)

    par 并行等待
        Database-->>Server: 查询中...
    and
        Note over Server: 3s 超时
    end

    Server->>Server: ctx.Done() 触发
    Server->>Database: 取消查询
    Database--xServer: 查询取消
    Server-->>Client: 返回超时错误

    Note over Server: goroutine 立即释放
